1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Your television can be more than
a screen for watching workouts.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:19,000
FormFit TV turns your preferences into a guided
exercise plan, controlled entirely with a remote.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
No typing or account setup
is needed to get started.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The builder guides you
through ten clear steps.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Choose your goal, experience,
available time and equipment,

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
then refine workout style, body focus,
movement position and recovery.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
You can also exclude exercises.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Each card explains its effect,

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
while checkmarks distinguish your choices
from the remote's current focus.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
These choices become a real request
to Amazon API Gateway.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Lambda validates the preferences and builds
a workout using catalogue rules,

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
then stores the plan in DynamoDB.
This is rule-based personalization,

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
not an AI claim. The generated workout
immediately appears in Recent Sessions.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:29,000
During the workout, the television manages
exercise timing, sets, rest and transitions locally.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
The remote lets me pause, resume,
finish a set or skip an exercise.

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Keeping execution local means
an interrupted connection

17
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:45,000
does not need to interrupt the timer.

18
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Here is the completion
from that recorded session.

19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Progress separates completed exercises,
skips and actual active time.

20
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Generated plans and completed sessions
share one history, so users can return

21
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:10,000
to a previous workout without confusing
plan creation with exercise completion.

22
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Built on React Native TV, FormFit separates shared
interface components, workout logic and cloud services.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:28,000
A persistent guest TV ID groups
each installation's records without sign-in.

24
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:37,000
FormFit makes personalized, remote-controlled fitness
available on the screen already in your living room.
